error[E0191]: Card's Body is markup (opttarget.Node): a Call sends its component's props, and markup can't be sent; pass what it is made of, and let the component render it
  --> err_call.vuka:21:50
   |
21 |         <button onClick={opttarget.JS.Call(Card{ID: 1, Body: <b>x</b>})} />
   |                                                        ^^^^
   |
   = help: open a component with its props as values: ui.JS.Call(components.EditProduct{ID: p.ID, OnSave: Reload})

error[E0191]: Card's Children is markup (opttarget.Node): a Call sends its component's props, and markup can't be sent; pass what it is made of, and let the component render it
  --> err_call.vuka:22:43
   |
22 |         <button onClick={opttarget.JS.Call(Card{Children: <b>x</b>})} />
   |                                                 ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: open a component with its props as values: ui.JS.Call(components.EditProduct{ID: p.ID, OnSave: Reload})

error[E0191]: Card's Rows is markup ([]struct{Cell opttarget.Node}): a Call sends its component's props, and markup can't be sent; pass what it is made of, and let the component render it
