error[E0191]: 3 follows the component Card{ID: 1}: a Call of a component takes its props in the component's value, and CallOptions (or a Size) after it
  --> err_call.vuka:26:51
   |
26 |         <button onClick={opttarget.JS.Call(Card{ID: 1}, 3)} />
   |                                                         ^
   |
   = help: open a component with its props as values: ui.JS.Call(components.EditProduct{ID: p.ID, OnSave: Reload})

error[E0191]: Closed follows a Call of a script's function, "confetti": it runs once the component a Call opened closes
  --> err_call.vuka:27:50
   |
27 |         <button onClick={opttarget.JS.Call("confetti").Closed(opttarget.JS.Show("#x"))} />
   |                                                        ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: give the Call a component, or drop Closed

error[E0191]: Closed follows a Push: it runs once the component a Call opened closes
  --> err_call.vuka:28:48
   |
28 |         <button onClick={opttarget.JS.Push(p.Render).Closed(opttarget.JS.Show("#x"))} />
   |                                                      ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: put it after a Call of a component: ui.JS.Call(components.Details{ID: id}).Closed(…)

For more information about this error, try `vuka explain E0191`.
